{"type":"message","id":"99936af9","parentId":"9e81c6c8","timestamp":"2026-03-16T10:17:08.636Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering skill development**\n\nI might not need to dwell on references, but creating a skill is on my mind. I think it would be helpful to write a script to call the endpoint. I wonder if there are existing examples of similar skill pipelines that I could check out for guidance. Looking at those might provide some insights that could streamline my process. Let's see what I can uncover!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0338ba20461faad80169b7d8a0cae08191a4717823e5214cf9\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpt9ikOdMxv3tXt4qdIaDMeF1YedkCJlRC2-Xz076kRDtkXzyPMqOLGkHkvuN6VinGKl3yvDOfvSZmi9pnwljZtKcuo-gRT2fsuMvBHkTFyNT0zWACgg_lt4emJZyQw0yp-utpd7sgEZHWn-iy5MmDG58uYNsIcRQdLlA0PMwZnHU3nxnc44neP0OvfzdSa_QHhrx40OHWMdOFrkIhcFPWu7RCwOhXpzMzNEQ3YsMfQzkaQFJNasq4vCxxGfRRDGOVaHW-XY05trxRE1fOEax22ENpyNwZ4zquWNO6am7oD2N-XOWhVjKdenmmBJNeAalW6i_OlPvdW3ZnIV0EdLLvljN0TzWEfPgAICZmWlewyu_1e9pJhxsWf4FqWwav07zvrgbFed-kuhVBK8ECx9ik2tcnvD4UAzqPUtltbJ8blVUl7W1Rmidz5HFiOpFGjoKo-bQbzAIyZ_Bb8L3hDSF_2nvW7vlnlPUbJKy-6UZ43Ced-grIzoXZbP1CTxcubSrlXohk-WrBUf5Sdb84WZa65kTDwDRJgoTDezR2jYobYSC9L_jCo9X91EBT_xT8gw3gV5VDeIY9moWhixQRFzJvNYY7fiRkF4UHp8g85Jo7gOQEydu3zxKT5sjRk-ujjl-Jmewm2fKA5NjshMMzww-pZ8Z8uu3Y_jdRhIYmahP_jTRGMxfVeZsW8bXlME4_bj1qAmIpu4spQbIo-fTX0GqSuwWgBaofey6K-qmK-8vz3WVwica8P8qmZJwuFnKkBvCIZUDJB5cjarFBch_LHqeH2VpS7ZGD_ikcMKXUdeyg10dZ5zrBENQwG2uXYqmbsrZFWMAMXkWin4BgrNkUK_W3LGGBNxkOezdLRbKf7hIpVmK_MdkWTbFq5BjvdmIujBEvfjm0Nj4ek7iL8U91HQ_ZTZtcAW5ISCdQrZzJzCFRJGsQbUCwy2z_ECBnq7H331wrlrhLkRUCNTLQxuS9ZWuZD_ODQuUaQGqEOoYVVXR9hupdfU6EL7HIH6zOPmnRPdm70jWARmAQ1uDYcOzRBdABA8LMkWeI3KZWZ2Dr1uggLmAmIlmBwq7932ojleFjsT4Fkat_\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering skill development**\\n\\nI might not need to dwell on references, but creating a skill is on my mind. I think it would be helpful to write a script to call the endpoint. I wonder if there are existing examples of similar skill pipelines that I could check out for guidance. Looking at those might provide some insights that could streamline my process. Let's see what I can uncover!\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_Uk2f1nYq2QpRisPDMfI4PRhr|fc_0338ba20461faad80169b7d8a49820819188fdd1a1bc76035f","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/skills/pipeline-generator/SKILL.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/skills/pipeline-generator/SKILL.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_TBNSNaCYNzvf0wWZTPkknNu6|fc_0338ba20461faad80169b7d8a498308191b4ad8028ff88d415","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -R /home/node/.openclaw/skills/pipeline-generator","workdir":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"ls -R /home/node/.openclaw/skills/pipeline-generator\",\"workdir\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":205,"output":132,"cacheRead":17280,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17617,"cost":{"input":0.0005125,"output":0.00198,"cacheRead":0.00432,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0068125}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773656223569}}
{"type":"message","id":"cdbc76f8","parentId":"99936af9","timestamp":"2026-03-16T10:17:08.652Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Uk2f1nYq2QpRisPDMfI4PRhr|fc_0338ba20461faad80169b7d8a49820819188fdd1a1bc76035f","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: pipeline-generator\ndescription: Generate an ML pipeline prototype by sending a user prompt to http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4010/nodes/ai_tool/AutoGen-model and reading the returned Answer field. Use only when the user explicitly asks for an ML pipeline prototype to be defined/generated, then explain the returned pipeline at a high level.\n---\n\n# Pipeline Generator\n\nGenerate a draft ML pipeline design from the remote AutoGen endpoint, then translate it into a concise, high-level explanation for the user.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Confirm the request is explicit.\n   - Use this skill only if the user clearly asks for an ML pipeline prototype/definition.\n\n2. Build the generation prompt.\n   - Use the user request directly.\n   - If details are missing, add minimal assumptions (data type, target, constraints) and label them as assumptions.\n\n3. Call the endpoint.\n   - Run:\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/generate_pipeline.py \"<prompt>\"\n```\n\n- The script sends JSON input `{ \"prompt\": \"...\" }` to:\n  `http://looporchestra.sytes.net:8001/nodes/ai_tool/AutoGen-model`\n- It expects JSON output with `Answer` and prints that value. There is also the base64 of an image outputted, ignore it.\n\n4. Explain the result at a high level.\n   - Summarize the pipeline into plain language.\n   - Cover: objective, data flow, model/training approach, evaluation, and deployment/monitoring idea.\n   - Keep it strategic and high-level (avoid code-level detail unless asked).\n\n5. Flag uncertainty.\n   - If endpoint output is ambiguous, say what is unclear and propose a refined follow-up prompt.\n\n## Output pattern\n\nReturn:\n\n- **Generated pipeline (raw)**: short excerpt or full text (if short)\n- **High-level explanation**: bullet summary of stages and purpose\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773656228645}}
